msgid ""
"Requests that :class:`~scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.httpcache."
"HttpCacheMiddleware` serves from the cache are also counted, even though "
"they are never sent, because it handles requests after :class:`~scrapy."
"downloadermiddlewares.stats.DownloaderStats`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/stats.rst:175
msgid "``downloader/request_method_count/{method}``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/stats.rst:176
msgid ""
"Number of requests sent, per HTTP method, e.g. ``GET`` or ``POST``. As with :"
"stat:`downloader/request_count`, requests served from the cache are also "
